<mjml>
  <mj-head>
    <!--
      Let's Rally — waitlist welcome email (MJML source)
      ----------------------------------------------------------------
      Sent to each new contact when they join the waitlist.

      Subject:  You're on the list — Let's Rally is almost here
      Preview:  The good plans are the easy ones. We'll ping you the
                moment it's ready for your crew.

      How to use in Loops:
        1. Loops → Emails → New email → "Upload custom email" and paste
           this MJML (Loops accepts MJML and compiles it for you).
        2. Trigger it from a Loop (automation) on "Contact added" (or the
           form) so every new sign-up receives it automatically.
        3. {unsubscribe_link} is a Loops tag — it becomes a per-contact
           unsubscribe URL on send. Loops requires it, so keep it.
      ----------------------------------------------------------------
    -->
    <mj-title>You're on the list — Let's Rally</mj-title>
    <mj-preview>The good plans are the easy ones. We'll ping you the moment Let's Rally is ready for your crew.</mj-preview>
    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-all font-family="'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" />
      <mj-text color="#3d3a36" font-size="16px" line-height="1.65" padding="0" />
      <mj-section padding="0" />
    </mj-attributes>
    <mj-style>
      a { color: #ff735f; }
    </mj-style>
  </mj-head>

  <mj-body background-color="#f8f2e9" width="600px">

    <!-- Header / brand band -->
    <mj-section background-color="#151515" padding="26px 40px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text>
          <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
            <tr>
              <td style="padding-right:12px;">
                <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                  <tr>
                    <td align="center" valign="middle" width="40" height="40" style="width:40px;height:40px;background-color:#ff735f;border-radius:50%;color:#151515;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;">R</td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
              </td>
              <td style="color:#f8f2e9;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.02em;">let's rally</td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- Hero headline -->
    <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="44px 40px 8px 40px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text color="#ff735f" font-size="12px" font-weight="800" letter-spacing="0.16em" text-transform="uppercase" padding-bottom="14px">
          More time with your people, coming soon
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text color="#151515" font-size="40px" line-height="1.02" font-weight="800" letter-spacing="-0.04em">
          You're on the list.
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- Body copy -->
    <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="20px 40px 8px 40px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text color="#151515" font-size="17px" line-height="1.6" font-weight="600" padding-bottom="18px">
          Thanks for rallying with us early — the good plans are the easy ones, and you'll be among the first to make them.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          Let's Rally is for the little plans that make a week better: the coffee run, the sunset walk, the last-minute "come meet us." Float the idea, and Let's Rally brings in the friends who are actually up for it — then gives the plan one temporary chat to make it happen. No group-text herding required.
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- Three steps -->
    <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="24px 40px 8px 40px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-divider border-width="1px" border-color="#ece4d7" padding="8px 0" />
        <mj-text padding="6px 0">
          <span style="color:#ff735f;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;">01&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style="color:#151515;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;">Float the idea</span><br/>
          <span style="color:#6b665e;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;">Pick a plan while it's still fresh — no big production required.</span>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-divider border-width="1px" border-color="#ece4d7" padding="8px 0" />
        <mj-text padding="6px 0">
          <span style="color:#ff735f;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;">02&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style="color:#151515;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;">Find the right few</span><br/>
          <span style="color:#6b665e;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;">Let's Rally invites the friends who are into that kind of hang — or you choose exactly who gets the nudge.</span>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-divider border-width="1px" border-color="#ece4d7" padding="8px 0" />
        <mj-text padding="6px 0">
          <span style="color:#ff735f;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;">03&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style="color:#151515;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;">Make it easy</span><br/>
          <span style="color:#6b665e;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;">One temporary chat keeps the details moving until everyone's together — then gets out of the way.</span>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-divider border-width="1px" border-color="#ece4d7" padding="8px 0" />
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- What's next -->
    <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="26px 40px 8px 40px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text>
          We're putting the finishing touches on it. The moment Let's Rally is ready for your crew, you'll be one of the first to know — no spam in between, just the invitation.
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- Sign-off -->
    <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="18px 40px 8px 40px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text color="#151515" font-size="16px" line-height="1.6" font-weight="600">
          See you soon,<br/>The Let's Rally team
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- P.S. / referral hook -->
    <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="16px 40px 40px 40px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text container-background-color="#f8f2e9" padding="16px 18px" color="#151515" font-size="14px" line-height="1.55">
          <strong style="color:#d64f3d;">P.S.</strong> Know someone who's always the one planning? Forward this their way — Let's Rally is better with the whole crew.
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <mj-section background-color="#151515" padding="26px 40px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text color="#f8f2e9" font-size="14px" font-weight="800" letter-spacing="-0.01em" padding-bottom="6px">
          let's rally
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text font-size="13px" padding-bottom="14px">
          <a href="mailto:hello@letsrallyapp.com" style="color:#ff735f;text-decoration:none;">hello@letsrallyapp.com</a>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text color="#8a857c" font-size="12px" line-height="1.5">
          You're receiving this because you joined the Let's Rally waitlist.<br/>
          <a href="{unsubscribe_link}" style="color:#8a857c;text-decoration:underline;">Unsubscribe</a>
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

  </mj-body>
</mjml>
